### 2. API (Backend)

#### [NEW] `controllers/megasale.js`

| Method | Route | Auth | Description |
|--------|-------|------|-------------|
| `GET` | `/admin/megasale/settings` | Admin | Global settings + all SKU entries with product info |
| `PUT` | `/admin/megasale/settings` | Admin | Update global toggle, timers |
| `POST` | `/admin/megasale/products` | Admin | Add SKU(s) to mega sale |
| `PUT` | `/admin/megasale/product/:id` | Admin | Update SKU entry (timer, active, serial) |
| `DELETE` | `/admin/megasale/product/:id` | Admin | Remove SKU from mega sale |

